  description: "4 Level 3 DARK monsters\nThis card cannot be destroyed by battle,
    also all battle damage you take from battles involving this card is also inflicted
    to your opponent. If this card has \"Number 96: Dark Mist\" as an Xyz Material,
    it gains this effect.\n\u25CF Once per battle, during either player's turn, when
    an attack is declared involving this card and an opponent's monster: You can
    detach 1 Xyz Material from this card; the ATK of the opponent's monster becomes
    0, and if it does, this card gains ATK equal to the original ATK of the opponent's
    monster."
